# Environment for the vendors' own evaluators (presidio-research notebooks 4/5
# and PIIBench's run_benchmarking). Separate from ../requirements.lock because
# presidio-evaluator 0.3.2 needs spaCy >= 3.8 and transformers >= 5.3.
# presidio-analyzer's [transformers] extra is omitted on purpose: it pins
# transformers < 5, and notebook 5's HuggingFaceNerRecognizer needs only
# transformers + torch.
